"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>9</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-26\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">26</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/21\">合并两个有序链表</a><p>LC 21</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>9</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-28\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">28</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/82\">删除排序链表中的重复元素 II</a><p>LC 82</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>9</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-37\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">37</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/92\">反转链表 II</a><p>LC 92</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>6</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-44\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">44</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/own-algo-gap-kth-list-node\">链表倒数第 K 个节点</a><p>无 LC 题号</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>6</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-47\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">47</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/2\">两数相加</a><p>LC 2</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-54\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">54</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#algo-gap-435\">无重叠区间</a><p>LC 435 · 解法在本页</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>本页题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-63\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">63</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/nonlc-4-1\">线程安全的 LRU</a><p>无 LC 题号</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-64\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">64</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/148\">链表排序（ACM 格式），dummy 节点是否必须，为何用归并</a><p>LC 148</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article></div><section class=\"kb-lecture\" id=\"algo-gap-435\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">54. 无重叠区间</h3><p class=\"md-p\">LC435。榜单把它归在链表里，题本身是区间贪心：删掉最少的区间，使剩下的互不重叠。端点相接不算重叠。</p><p class=\"md-p\">按结束时间升序。已经保留的区间里，结束最早的那个最容易接上下一个。当前起点不早于上一个结束，就保留，否则丢掉。答案是总数减去保留数。</p><p class=\"md-p\">按起点排序会错：先碰到一个拉得很长的区间，会挡住后面很多短区间。和 LC56 合并区间不是同一问，56 要输出合并后的段，这题只问删几个。</p><div class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><span class=\"file-label\">Solution.java</span></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">int eraseOverlapIntervals(int[][] a) {\n    Arrays.sort(a, (x, y) -&gt; Integer.compare(x[1], y[1]));\n    int keep = 0, end = Integer.MIN_VALUE;\n    for (int[] seg : a) {\n        if (seg[0] &gt;= end) { keep++; end = seg[1]; }\n    }\n    return a.length - keep;\n}</pre></div></div><p class=\"md-p\">排序 O(n log n)，扫描 O(n)。区间端点用 int 比较，不要减出来比较，极端值会溢出。<a href=\"#/e/p-greedy\">贪心与区间专题 →</a></p></section></section><section class=\"kb-map-section\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\" id=\"algo-type-dp\">动态规划（13 道）</h3><p class=\"md-p\"><a href=\"#/e/p-dp\">打开动态规划 · 专题 →</a></p><div class=\"kb-points\"><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-12\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">12</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/5\">最长回文子串</a><p>LC 5</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>14</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-13\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">13</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/300\">最长递增子序列</a><p>LC 300</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>14</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-14\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">14</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/70\">爬楼梯</a><p>LC 70</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>14</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-22\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">22</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/1143\">最长公共子序列</a><p>LC 1143</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>10</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-24\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">24</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/121\">买卖股票的最佳时机</a><p>LC 121</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>10</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-29\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">29</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/322\">零钱兑换</a><p>LC 322</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>8</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-31\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">31</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/72\">编辑距离</a><p>LC 72</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>7</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-36\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb