\"kb-frequency\"><b>13</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-17\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">17</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/1\">两数之和</a><p>LC 1</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>13</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-33\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">33</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/560\">和为 K 的子数组</a><p>LC 560</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>7</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-60\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">60</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/128\">最长连续序列</a><p>LC 128</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-65\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">65</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/lc-face-extra-20\">长度最小的子数组</a><p>LC 209</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article></div></section><section class=\"kb-map-section\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\" id=\"algo-type-str\">字符串 / 大数（5 道）</h3><p class=\"md-p\"><a href=\"#/e/p-array\">打开数组 / 矩阵 / 字符串模拟 · 专题 →</a></p><div class=\"kb-points\"><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-23\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">23</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/43\">大数乘法</a><p>LC 43</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>10</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-35\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">35</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/415\">字符串相加</a><p>LC 415</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>7</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-42\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">42</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/165\">比较版本号</a><p>LC 165</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>6</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-53\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">53</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/8\">实现 atoi</a><p>LC 8</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-57\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">57</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#algo-gap-ip-port\">IP + 端口转成 uint64</a><p>无 LC 题号 · 解法在本页</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>本页题解 →</span></div></article></div><section class=\"kb-lecture\" id=\"algo-gap-ip-port\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\">57. IP + 端口转成 uint64</h3><p class=\"md-p\">IPv4 是 4 个 0~255 的字节，端口是 0~65535。放进一个 64 位无符号数时要先说布局：这里把 IP 放在低 32 位之上的 16 位空档之外，也就是 IP 占 [47,16]，端口占 [15,0]，最高 16 位是 0。</p><p class=\"md-p\">每一段先校验再移位。Java 的 int 是有符号的，单字节左移前要转成 long，否则 192&lt;&lt;24 会变成负数，再或端口时高位被符号扩展。</p><div class=\"code-card md-code-card\"><div class=\"code-toolbar\"><span class=\"file-label\">Solution.java</span></div><div class=\"code-scroll\"><pre class=\"md-pre\" data-lang=\"java\">long pack(int a, int b, int c, int d, int port) {\n    if ((a | b | c | d) &lt; 0 || a &gt; 255 || b &gt; 255 || c &gt; 255 || d &gt; 255)\n        throw new IllegalArgumentException(&quot;ip&quot;);\n    if (port &lt; 0 || port &gt; 65535) throw new IllegalArgumentException(&quot;port&quot;);\n    long ip = ((long) a &lt;&lt; 24) | ((long) b &lt;&lt; 16) | ((long) c &lt;&lt; 8) | d;\n    return (ip &lt;&lt; 16) | port;\n}</pre></div></div><p class=\"md-p\">拆开是反向移位再掩 0xff / 0xffff。如果面试官要把端口放在高 16 位，先改布局再写，不要默默换。只转 IP、不带端口的写法在 <a href=\"#/e/nonlc-5-4\">IP 转 32 位无符号整数 →</a></p></section></section><section class=\"kb-map-section\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\" id=\"algo-type-stack\">栈 / 队列（4 道）</h3><p class=\"md-p\"><a href=\"#/e/p-stack\">打开栈 / 单调栈 / 单调队列 · 专题 →</a></p><div class=\"kb-points\"><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-10\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">10</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/20\">有效的括号</a><p>LC 20</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>14</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-18\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">18</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/32\">最长有效括号</a><p>LC 32</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>11</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-52\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">52</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/155\">基于数组实现栈，O(1) 获取最小值，兼顾线程安全</a><p>LC 155</p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-61\"><div class=\"kb-point-main\"><span class=\"kb-point-no\">61</span><div><a class=\"kb-point-title\" href=\"#/e/225\">用队列实现栈、用栈实现队列</a><p>LC 225 · <a href=\"#/e/lc-face-extra-23\">另一半 LC232</a></p></div></div><div class=\"kb-point-meta\"><span class=\"kb-frequency\"><b>5</b> 次</span><span>题解 →</span></div></article></div></section><section class=\"kb-map-section\"><h3 class=\"md-h md-h3\" id=\"algo-type-back\">回溯（3 道）</h3><p class=\"md-p\"><a href=\"#/e/p-backtrack\">打开回溯 · 专题 →</a></p><div class=\"kb-points\"><article class=\"kb-point\" id=\"algo-board-19\"><div class=\"kb-point-